            "params": {
              "text": "<p><strong>Module Outcomes</strong></p><hr><ul><li>Describe key findings of current research on the importance of young children’s development of strong social and emotional skills for well-being and future school and lifelong success.</li><li>List specific social and emotional skills appropriate for 3-4-year-old children.</li></ul><p>Access Week 1 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://new-moodle.oecs.org/course/view.php?id=96&amp;section=2\">HERE</a></p>"
